WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Import the image and compare the original with the halftone effect in one window. Transparent artwork can also continue through halftone processing.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Set the finished width and lines per inch, then compare tone-preserving and full-image dot patterns.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Additional settings include resolution, screen angle, diameter ratio and black-removal threshold. Adjust one at a time and zoom in to inspect details.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:49.200
When ready, open the result in Photoshop and continue to artwork preparation and layout.
